 para mim por que recusou a oferta dele?","e":"Can you explain to me why you refused his offer?","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.924105,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"6f70a7618c91a6e307f9fad83ef2c14c","i":"80680251355d51e7b9799b2c30c70ffd","r":"1845238:630571","c":"nowasky","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1845238","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1845238","b":"Tatoeba sentence #1845238 by nowasky; English translation #630571 by vicch","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1845238","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"O problema é que a maioria recusou protecção.","e":"The problem is most of them said, \"No thanks.\"","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.557327,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"54633cfe5df4feea6bcab1d22c7a2dfb","i":"896a61872043ac6363a1246d39263620","r":"6135658:6772779:314:4229243","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6135658","6772779","314"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Ele perdeu sua posição só porque ele se recusou a contar uma mentira.","e":"He lost his position just because he refused to tell a lie.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.864796,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"b40cd4a768ff76473e764edfc5e5b6b6","i":"cc9596a59d185120512ee43d40ec1226","r":"2857050:40889","c":"MarlonX19","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2857050","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2857050","b":"Tatoeba sentence #2857050 by MarlonX19; English translation #40889 by CM","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2857050","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Ele mesmo se recusou a falar com ela.","e":"He himself refused to talk to her.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.933184,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"1d67930f15920c21a6fed296ff3e4d11","i":"eae84614b5c1b068375cc8e2dc735181","r":"881406:881405","c":"alexmarcelo","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/881406","ul":"https://ta