fe, and she refused my generosity.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.841518,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"212f214cac499702ed9397f3bb83a758","i":"997d6fe54c78b525c6d3a4157ad67bcb","r":"6096392:6981317:437:4893062","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6096392","6981317","437"],"w":["leaf",0]}]]},"446c6077":{"m":[[],[{"t":"Diz que foi um acidente e recusa o teste da violação.","e":"You said it was an accident and refused the rape kit.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.661587,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"df7386b03b50d213f21d90ef14741897","i":"01b9c82db8ac1811342daf7e5250209a","r":"3255826:7014832:164:316214","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3255826","7014832","164"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Ouvi que o teu próprio irmão se recusa a vir aqui.","e":"I've heard that your own brother refuses to come here.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.916616,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"6cd503c8e50fe37ed75c873c38dfef81","i":"620a03b8d476a07bea8971fb61107ced","r":"4289366:6109453:218:1258610","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4289366","6109453","218"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Quando uma miúda gosta e é convidada para sair, não recusa.","e":"When a girl likes you and you ask her out, most of the time she doesn't say no.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.721959,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"257a71108e6b87e28f45675f99dcc985","i":"b77f214ac8868510e0afd34b38532dab","r":"5616030:7048916:495:4578746","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5616030","7048916","495"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Deduzo pelo seu comportamento que recusa a oferta que lhe fiz.","e":"I'm gonna take your behavior as a \"no\" to my earlier offer.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.746019,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"207365310b0